From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Davidlohr Bueso <dave@stgolabs.net>
Date: Mon, 2 Feb 2026 11:13:30 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] cxl/region: Fix leakage in __construct_region()

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2143032

Failing the first sysfs_update_group() needs to explicitly
kfree the resource as it is too early for cxl_region_iomem_release()
to do so.

Signed-off-by: Davidlohr Bueso <dave@stgolabs.net>
Reviewed-by: Ira Weiny <ira.weiny@intel.com>
Reviewed-by: Gregory Price <gourry@gourry.net>
Fixes: d6602e25819d (cxl/region: Add support to indicate region has extended linear cache)
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260202191330.245608-1-dave@stgolabs.net
Signed-off-by: Dave Jiang <dave.jiang@intel.com>
(cherry picked from commit 77b310bb7b5ff8c017524df83292e0242ba89791)
Signed-off-by: Jiandi An <jan@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Jamie Nguyen <jamien@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Nirmoy Das <nirmoyd@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Carol L Soto <csoto@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Matthew R. Ochs <mochs@nvidia.com>
Signed-off-by: Brad Figg <bfigg@nvidia.com>
Ledger-Change: C-00622
Ledger-Origin: nvidia-6.17@7f05849bf5c03935f2c70db4e04c802abba34231
---
 drivers/cxl/core/region.c | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/cxl/core/region.c b/drivers/cxl/core/region.c
index d8f34cb5e812..ef71b660e8ac 100644
--- a/drivers/cxl/core/region.c
+++ b/drivers/cxl/core/region.c
@@ -3587,8 +3587,10 @@ static int __construct_region(struct cxl_region *cxlr,
 	}
 
 	rc = sysfs_update_group(&cxlr->dev.kobj, &cxl_region_group);
-	if (rc)
+	if (rc) {
+		kfree(res);
 		return rc;
+	}
 
 	rc = insert_resource(cxlrd->res, res);
 	if (rc) {
